# Doc Detail

::summary
The doc detail surface in the shell wrapper: circled icon-only back + crumb trail, icon-only Ask Surfy / Share / ⋯ detail bar (G3), meta line, and the rendered SurfDoc body. The ⋯ menu is `modals/doc-menu.surf` (anchored dropdown-select); the Share / Rename / Version history / Move-Copy sheets live in `modals/` — no inline copies.
::

